{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"BIT-apisix-2026-94212","published":"2026-10-09T10:43:47.772Z","modified":"2026-10-09T12:00:03.566955986Z","aliases":["CVE-2026-94212"],"summary":"Apache APISIX: unauthenticated impersonation issue in saml-auth","details":"Improper verification of cryptographic signature vulnerability in Apache APISIX.\n\n\n\nAny unauthenticated attacker could impersonate any user on every route protected by the saml-auth plugin under default configuration. This issue affects Apache APISIX: from 3.17.0 through 3.18.0.\n\n\n\nUsers are recommended to upgrade to version 3.19.0, which fixes the issue.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"apisix","ecosystem":"Bitnami","purl":"pkg:bitnami/apisix"},"ranges":[{"type":"SEMVER","events":[{"introduced":"3.17.0"},{"fixed":"3.19.0"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/bitnami/vulndb/tree/main/data/apisix/BIT-apisix-2026-94212.json"},"severity":[{"type":"CVSS_V4","score":"CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:N/VA:N/SC:H/SI:H/SA:N/E:X/CR:X/IR:X/AR:X/MAV:X/MAC:X/MAT:X/MPR:X/MUI:X/MVC:X/MVI:X/MVA:X/MSC:X/MSI:X/MSA:X/S:X/AU:X/R:X/V:X/RE:X/U:X"}]}],"references":[{"type":"WEB","url":"http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/10/01/4"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/1230fnojnmc7bfz3n0nkt7tkcld9d1sc"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-94212"}],"database_specific":{"cpes":["cpe:2.3:a:apache:apisix:*:*:*:*:*:*:*:*"],"severity":"Medium"}}